  "content_description": "Ethics",
  "content_text_body": "Encourage team members to follow the appropriate procedures when they witness behavior that does not match the ethics policies and practices at your company. \n\nThis is often a difficult situation for people since it takes courage to report ethics violations. As a manager, support your employees to speak up and take the right actions to promote a transparent workplace:\n\n* Ensure that team members know to who or where they can report incidences.\n\n* Discuss that their feedback will be treated with confidentiality. \n\n* Reminder employees there will be no retaliation against them. \n\nFailure to acknowledge and report ethics violations can validate these behaviors and create the impression that they are tolerated in the workplace. Further, they have the potential to impact organizational culture and integrity.",
